message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: atmoflux
abstract: >-
  Python library for atmospheric and surface flux calculations relevant to climate, 
  micrometeorology, and urban environmental research. The package provides modular 
  tools for radiative, turbulent, hydrological, aerosol, and energy balance calculations, 
  alongside supporting utilities for atmospheric state variables and physical constants.
